IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. T. DATA DIVISION. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256). 01 G. 05 A PIC X VALUE 'A'. 05 B PIC X VALUE 'B'. PROCEDURE DIVISION. CALL 'S1' BY CONTENT G. DISPLAY G.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING G DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "AB"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [AB] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. STOP RUN. IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. S1. DATA DIVISION. LINKAGE SECTION. 01 G2. 05 C PIC X. 05 D PIC X. PROCEDURE DIVISION USING G2. MOVE 'X' TO C. EXIT PROGRAM. END PROGRAM S1.

